Root cause:
The bug was caused by the potential for `cxl_decoder_commit()` to leak a hold of `cxl_dpa_rwsem` due to an unhandled error case when setting up targets. Specifically, if the interleave ways exceeded the allowed limits, it could lead to incorrect configurations being committed without proper validation, resulting in resource management issues.

